{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 13,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "“Indeed, my eyes have seen all this; my ears have heard and understood.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What you know, I also know; I am not inferior to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet I desire to speak to the Almighty and argue my case before God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You, however, smear with lies; you are all worthless physicians.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If only you would remain silent; for that would be your wisdom!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear now my argument, and listen to the plea of my lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Will you speak wickedly on God’s behalf or speak deceitfully for Him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Would you show Him partiality or argue in His defense?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Would it be well when He examined you? Could you deceive Him as you would deceive a man?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely He would rebuke you if you secretly showed partiality.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Would His majesty not terrify you? Would the dread of Him not fall upon you?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Your maxims are proverbs of ashes; your defenses are defenses of clay.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be silent, and I will speak. Then let come to me what may.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why do I put myself at risk and take my life in my own hands?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though He slay me, I will hope in Him. I will still defend my ways to His face.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Moreover, this will be my salvation, for no godless man can appear before Him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Listen carefully to my words; let my declaration ring in your ears.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "See now, I have prepared my case; I know that I will be vindicated.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Can anyone indict me? If so, I will be silent and die.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Only grant these two things to me, so that I need not hide from You:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Withdraw Your hand from me, and do not let Your terror frighten me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then call me, and I will answer, or let me speak, and You can reply.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How many are my iniquities and sins? Reveal to me my transgression and sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why do You hide Your face and consider me as Your enemy?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Would You frighten a windblown leaf? Would You chase after dry chaff?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For You record bitter accusations against me and bequeath to me the iniquities of my youth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You put my feet in the stocks and stand watch over all my paths; You set a limit for the soles of my feet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.13.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So man wastes away like something rotten, like a moth-eaten garment.[’’]",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
